{"id":"wb-6-335","name":"时恩寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"时恩寺","text":"时恩寺是中国河北省张家口市宣化区的佛教寺院，位于镇朔楼西侧百米处。时恩寺大殿是寺院仅存的明清时期建筑，是全国重点文物保护单位。时恩寺建筑面积350平方米。2005年开始，时恩寺开始维修、扩建，新建有山门、配殿、僧寮等寺院建筑，总面积达到3000平方米。考古学家宿白称时恩寺大殿“具有十五世纪甚至更早的建筑风格和鲜明的地方特色。”","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%97%B6%E6%81%A9%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":87194554,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=87194554","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/23ada3d924e51b7dc6b87ad3.jpg","title":"时恩寺大殿.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%97%B6%E6%81%A9%E5%AF%BA%E5%A4%A7%E6%AE%BF.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/37/%E6%97%B6%E6%81%A9%E5%AF%BA%E5%A4%A7%E6%AE%BF.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"HaziiDozen","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​时恩寺大殿","width":320,"height":240}}